  "description": "There was a peaceful time when dismissing prophecy as a conspiracy theory was considered a mark of intelligence. In The Day of the Apocalypse, 70% of humanity was wiped out by the Bora Virus; countless people died, and most of modern civilization was destroyed, with the sole exception of “Cheongdan City,” which never ceased its preparations in response to the “Prophet’s” warnings. Only when the Day of the Apocalypse arrived did people finally realize They realized how foolish they had been to dismiss the Prophet’s warnings as nonsense. They realized that there is no such thing as unchanging common sense or truth. Seo Mo-Rae, a Prophet, has now become everyone’s savior and messiah. J. Tae-Seong, a psychic hired to protect him, joins him. Their story, of two people living in a devastated world, begins.\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
